12 0 obj
<< /Length 4919 >>
stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (   stops MirrorMaker 2 and translates committed offsets for consumer group tc-stream-prd. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (   command is idempotent; if it times out, run it again rather than performing the steps) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (   manually.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (17. The Database lead verifies that tsdb-dr-01.euc1.tessera.meridian.internal accepts writes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 677 Td (   on port 5432 and that the application role can connect. Record the promotion timestamp.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 664 Td (18. The Kafka lead verifies that kafka-dr-01, kafka-dr-02 and kafka-dr-03 accept produce) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 651 Td (   requests on port 9093 and that all partitions of the telemetry topics have an in-sync) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (   leader.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 624 Td (Phase D: Start processing in euc1) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (19. The Operator starts tc-stream in euc1. The consumers join group tc-stream-prd using the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 589 Td (   translated offsets. Watch the consumer lag for the first 5 minutes; it should begin to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 576 Td (   fall.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 563 Td (20. The Operator confirms tc-api pods in euc1 report ready and that the API returns 200 on its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550 Td (   internal health check.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 537 Td (21. The Operator confirms tc-ingest in euc1 reports mode active on /healthz port 8081.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 523 Td (Phase E: Switch traffic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 501 Td (22. The Operator runs tcctl dns switch --target euc1. This updates) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 488 Td (   ingest.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com and api.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 475 Td (   to point at the euc1 load balancers. Record the time; clients honouring the 60-second TTL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 462 Td (   should arrive within about one minute.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 449 Td (23. The Operator monitors MQTT connection count on tc-ingest in euc1. Expect a rapid rise in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 436 Td (   the first 5 minutes followed by a slower tail. The connection count should reach at least) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 423 Td (   90 percent of the pre-incident baseline within 30 minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 410 Td (24. The Operator watches ingestion throughput. Throughput will temporarily exceed normal peak) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 397 Td (   as TS-4 gateways replay their buffers. The euc1 production profile is sized for 2.5 times) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 384 Td (   normal peak; if tc-ingest CPU stays above 85 percent for 10 minutes, scale further with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 371 Td (   tcctl scale --region euc1 --component tc-ingest --replicas 24.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 358 Td (25. The Communications lead updates status.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com to say that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 345 Td (   service has been restored from the secondary region and that historical data may take time) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 332 Td (   to backfill.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 318 Td (Phase F: Verify and stabilise) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 296 Td (26. The IC runs through the verification checklist in section 7 with the Operator and records) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 283 Td (   each result.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 270 Td (27. The Operator re-enables Forge deployments for tesseracloud-prod only if the IC agrees; by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 257 Td (   default the freeze stays in place until failback, and only emergency fixes are deployed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 244 Td (   through the ECAB process in the change management procedure.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 231 Td (28. The Operator raises a Beacon change record in category CHG-EMERG to document the failover) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 218 Td (   as an emergency change, linking the incident ticket.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 205 Td (29. The IC declares service restored, records the total time from the failover decision in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 192 Td (   step 5 to completion of step 26, and compares it against the 60-minute RTO.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 179 Td (30. The IC confirms the incident remains open as SEV1 until customer impact has ended, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 166 Td (   downgrades per the severity definitions and schedules the post-incident review within five) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 153 Td (   business days.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 137 Td (7. Verification checklist) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 116 Td (Check | How | Expected result) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 104 Td (DNS resolves to euc1 | Resolve ingest.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com and) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 92 Td (api.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com from two external networks | euc1 load balancer) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 80 Td (addresses) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 68 Td (Gateway connections | tc-ingest connection dashboard in euc1 | At least 90 percent of baseline) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 56 Td (within 30 minutes) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
