BT /F1 9 Tf 54 706 Td (api.tesseracloud.meridian-instruments.com port 443) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 694 Td (Database writes | Insert and read a canary row via tcctl db canary | Success within 1 second) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 682 Td (Kafka | tcctl kafka lag --group tc-stream-prd --region euc1 | Lag falling, no partitions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 670 Td (without leader) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 658 Td (Customer view | Log in to a demo tenant and open a live TS-4 dashboard | New readings within 2) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 646 Td (minutes) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 634 Td (Alerts pipeline | Trigger a test vibration threshold alert on demo tenant | Email and webhook) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 622 Td (delivered) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 610 Td (Billing export | Confirm Atlas billing job paused | Job shows HELD; re-run after failback) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 585 Td (8. Failback) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 563 Td (Failback returns traffic to euw1. It is a planned activity, not an emergency action, and it has) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 550 Td (its own risks, so it is not rushed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (- Failback is not started until TesseraCloud has run stably in euc1 for at least 24 hours,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 515 Td (   and the cause of the euw1 failure has been understood and fixed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 502 Td (- Failback is performed in a change window approved through CAB, or through ECAB if a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 489 Td (   business reason requires it sooner than the next CAB meeting. The change is raised in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 476 Td (   Beacon with a link to the original incident.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 463 Td (- Customers are notified at least 48 hours in advance through the status page, unless the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 450 Td (   change is approved via ECAB, in which case the notice period is agreed by the Approver.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 437 Td (The failback procedure in outline:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 415 Td (1. Rebuild or resynchronise TimescaleDB in euw1 as a replica of tsdb-dr-01, then re-establish) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 402 Td (   tsdb-prd-02 as a synchronous standby of tsdb-prd-01 once tsdb-prd-01 becomes primary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389 Td (   again.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (2. Reconfigure MirrorMaker 2 in the reverse direction, from euc1 to euw1, and wait for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (   replication lag below 30 seconds.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (3. Run tcctl failback plan to generate the ordered step list for the current state; the plan) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (   output is attached to the change record.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (4. Execute the plan during the change window: drain euc1 ingestion, promote euw1, switch DNS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 311 Td (   back, start tc-stream in euw1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298 Td (5. Restore normal MirrorMaker 2 direction from euw1 to euc1 and return euc1 to standby) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 285 Td (   capacity.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 272 Td (6. Lift the Forge deployment freeze and resume the Atlas billing export.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 256 Td (9. Known issues and troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 235 Td (Symptom | Likely cause | Action) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 223 Td (tcctl failover precheck --target euc1 reports WARN on capacity | euc1 capacity reservation not) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 211 Td (fully available | Continue; scale-up may take up to 20 minutes. Inform IC) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 199 Td (Promote command times out | Control plane API throttling in euc1 | Re-run tcctl failover) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 187 Td (promote --region euc1 --confirm; it is idempotent) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 175 Td (Consumer lag in euc1 not falling | Offset translation incomplete for some partitions | Kafka) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 163 Td (lead resets affected partitions to translated checkpoint; see Kafka runbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 151 Td (Some gateways never reconnect | Customer DNS caching or firewall allowing only euw1 addresses |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 139 Td (Communications lead contacts customer; customers should allow the documented TesseraCloud) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 127 Td (address ranges for both regions) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 115 Td (Duplicate readings in dashboards | Gateway replay overlapping data already replicated |) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 103 Td (Expected; tc-stream deduplicates on gateway sequence number within 24 hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 91 Td (Reconnect surge from some sites | Gateways on firmware older than 5.0.0 reconnect without) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 79 Td (backoff | Scale tc-ingest \(step 24\); record affected tenants and recommend a firmware upgrade) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 67 Td (API 401 errors after failover | Token signing key cache not warm in euc1 | Restart tc-api pods) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 55 Td (in euc1 one availability zone at a time) Tj ET
endstream
